      "content": "i try to have self compassion but it feels so fake. like i'm just lying to myself. everything i do just makes things harder for them. i look at my kid and i just feel this overwhelming sense that if i wasn't even here, life would actually be easier for them. less stress, less money problems, less of me dragging them down.",
